+# Wickle 마스코트 생성 기록
+
+- 생성일: 2026-09-12 (Asia/Seoul)
+- 생성 도구: 내장 `image_gen` 이미지 생성 도구
+- 용도: Wickle README와 프로젝트 소개용 고슴도치 마스코트
+- 파일: [wickle.png](wickle.png)
+
+## 생성 프롬프트
+
+```text
+Use case: stylized-concept
+Asset type: primary mascot illustration for the README of Wickle, an independent agent engine made by EpsilonDelta.
+
+Create one exceptionally adorable ORIGINAL baby hedgehog mascot joyfully trotting inside a small exercise wheel. The wheel symbolizes the engine's repeating reasoning and tool-use loop. The hedgehog should feel like a tiny, bright, curious, helpful companion that people immediately want to hug.
+
+Subject: a very round, squishy baby hedgehog with a large soft cream face and tummy, tiny round ears, a little button nose, big warm glossy dark eyes with delicate catchlights, subtle rosy cheeks, a small delighted smile, and four very short chubby paws. Keep the muzzle short and cute. Its back has soft chestnut-brown quills simplified into rounded, layered tufts, clearly recognizable as a hedgehog without looking sharp or aggressive. The quills and cream fur have a soft plush texture. Make its face the emotional focal point. A gentle curious head tilt looks toward the viewer while the body is in a believable little running pose.
+
+Scene: just this single hedgehog and its simple exercise wheel with a small stable base. The wheel is understated, with a solid running surface and an open visible front; its rim must not obscure the face. Keep all paws, quills, and the entire wheel visible. No additional characters, props, scenery, lettering, logos, or watermark.
+
+Style: premium soft 3D storybook mascot illustration with a handmade plush and clay feel, softly rounded forms, tactile delicate fur, warm natural colors, gentle diffuse studio lighting, and restrained soft shading. A clean memorable silhouette that remains cute when displayed small. Absolutely original character design, not a copy of an existing mascot or cartoon. Prioritize extreme cuteness and warmth over realism or technical detail.
+
+Composition: square, one centered complete character-and-wheel composition, three-quarter view, balanced breathing room around every edge. The hedgehog occupies a substantial part of the wheel so its face reads clearly at README size. Transparent background with real alpha, clean isolated edges, no white rectangle, no checkerboard, no background scene. Deliver a polished high-resolution PNG mascot asset, not a mockup, not a character sheet, and no text.
+```
